msgctxt "388"
msgid "Ngh... Damn, that hurts! Why'd you gotta hit me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Stings, doesn't it? A good punch can do that to anybody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Yeah, no shit! So what's your point?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Physical wounds will heal with time. But sometimes the\r\n"
"emotional ones stay with you forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Huh? You're saying I have some kind of... emotional wounds?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Yeah. The way I see it, you're just making excuses. You\r\n"
"think that throwing your dreams away will help get rid of\r\n"
"your problems, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Well, running away might bring temporary relief, but... once\r\n"
"you throw away your dreams, you can never get them back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Never...? Like, never ever?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Even if you do make it big with the IT venture, taking back\r\n"
"your dream of designing buildings would be a major struggle\r\n"
"at that point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"And I don't think some flake who can't even host his clients\r\n"
"right could handle that kind of struggle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "It all makes sense now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"All this time, I've been looking for excuses to run away\r\n"
"from my problems. That's why I'm in this mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm glad to hear you figured that out before it was\r\n"
"too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"It's kind of like I've been in a drunken stupor all this\r\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Well, if all it takes is a few punches to sober you up,\r\n"
"then I'm happy to oblige."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! I want you to have this as a token of my\r\n"
"gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"I'm not gonna quit the company! Instead, I'm gonna work my\r\n"
"knuckles to the bone, if need be, in order to reach those\r\n"
"dreams! So long, buddy, and thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Oh... I had a feeling we'd meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Seems like you always show up whenever I'm struggling with\r\n"
"something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "I could always just leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"No, no. Your advice really helps. And you're the only one\r\n"
"I can talk to about these things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Well, what is it this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Well, my senpai from college just quit his job, and he's\r\n"
"talking about starting up his own business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "He asked me if I wanna be his partner in this thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"So I've got this dilemma over whether I should keep my job\r\n"
"at the company, or help out my college senpai with his new\r\n"
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "What's this new business all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Well, that's the thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "What do you mean? Can't you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "It's an IT company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "IT? What does that have to do with architecture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "That's exactly right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Thing is, my senpai's really confident this IT business will\r\n"
"succeed. Then he says we can put it on the market...\r\n"
"And we can make a huge fortune!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I've heard that one plenty of times. Don't you think\r\n"
"it's a little late to be starting over in that field?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm afraid of. But at this rate, it'll take\r\n"
"years for me to get any significant building jobs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"And my college senpai says, even if we don't make bank...\r\n"
"Once the company goes public, millions of yen will\r\n"
"start flooding in anyway!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "I have to make a decision now. What do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "So it's all about money, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "I'm saying, is money the only thing you care about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"But... But weren't you the one lecturing me on how important\r\n"
"money is!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"I did say that. But back then, your head was filled with\r\n"
"dreams too big for you to catch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"I... I understand that! And it's pointless to\r\n"
"chase after a dream you'll never catch, right!?\r\n"
"So I'm pretty much screwed either way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"I figured, once I earn lots of money, then I can make a\r\n"
"different dream come true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid ""
"But if all you focus on is making big money, next thing you\r\n"
"know, you'll be consumed by it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"What the hell are you trying to say!? Are you just throwing\r\n"
"random advice at me like some kind of multiple choice in a\r\n"
"video game!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"I think you should do what you want. It's your life,\r\n"
"after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"What kind of answer is that!? Up to now, you've been telling\r\n"
"me to do either this or that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"Be an adult and take some responsibility for the things you\r\n"
"tell people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Come again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "I'm saying, don't give me that flimsy, ambiguous bullshit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "I'll take responsibility for any flimsy answers I've given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid ""
"But I'm not about to take responsibility for some flake who's\r\n"
"willing to throw away his dreams on a whim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"It's your fault that I have to throw away my dreams in the\r\n"
"first place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"If it wasn't for your lame advice, I might not be in this\r\n"
"mess!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"(This guy's pretty worked up. I should probably knock a\r\n"
"little sense into him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"Fine. You want me to take some responsibility? This is my\r\n"
"own special way of doing it. Get your notepad ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're that guy... Heheh... Well, guess what.\r\n"
"I just couldn't handle it after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Well, I slammed that letter of resignation on my boss's\r\n"
"table at the club, then he dragged me into the restroom\r\n"
"and started lecturing me to kingdom come..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"He told me to quit fuckin' around, slapped me in the head,\r\n"
"and went back out for a drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid ""
"So I went to the hostess club to resume my \"wining and\r\n"
"dining\" duties, and those old drunks asked me to entertain\r\n"
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid ""
"How's a new recruit like me supposed to know what men as old\r\n"
"as my father might like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I gave 'em a little magic trick I learned in college\r\n"
"and it pretty much bombed. They sure enjoyed berating me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid ""
"I just don't know what to do. At this rate, I'll never get\r\n"
"the kind of work I want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid ""
"If I stick it out and keep doing what I do now, I'll just be\r\n"
"miserable for the rest of my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Geez... Why should I even work at all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "For yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "You said there's something you wanted to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"It's still your first year on the job, right? You can't\r\n"
"expect everything to come easy right from the start.\r\n"
"Why don't you give it some time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Hmm... If I quit now, then it's all over..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"If I look at it like I'm in this for myself, then yeah. That\r\n"
"gives me a little more motivation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid ""
"We're hosting some clients at the sushi bar right now.\r\n"
"I'd better get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "For money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "So it really is all about the money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid ""
"You don't know how hard it is to be broke on the streets\r\n"
"without a job. I'm not saying money is everything, but it's\r\n"
"something you can't live without."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid ""
"You're right. It is a big company after all, and the pay's\r\n"
"not bad either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid ""
"I know that money's important, but still... It's like I've\r\n"
"lost all my enthusiasm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid ""
"Anyway, we're hosting some clients at the sushi bar right\r\n"
"now. I'd better get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1672"
msgid "For women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1684"
msgid "Women!? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1696"
msgid ""
"You're saying how much you hate those hostess clubs, but you\r\n"
"gotta look at this from a different angle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1708"
msgid ""
"You're a young, decent-looking guy who's getting paid to\r\n"
"drink with gorgeous women. What part of that doesn't\r\n"
"make you thankful to be alive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1720"
msgid ""
"I see... Well, I do know how the clubs work now. Maybe I\r\n"
"oughta visit 'em on my own sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1732"
msgid ""
"Yeah... This could actually be a good way to polish my\r\n"
"skills with the ladies. Not a bad idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1744"
msgid ""
"Well, we're hosting some clients at the sushi bar right now.\r\n"
"I'd better get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1840"
msgid "Whew... That's better. Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1852"
msgid "You okay now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1864"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I never drank that much alcohol before in my life.\r\n"
"I thought I was gonna die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1876"
msgid "A man should know his limits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1888"
msgid ""
"I suppose so... Sorry for the trouble. I had to take some\r\n"
"clients out on the town for the night, you see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1900"
msgid ""
"And I'm still in my first year at the company, so I can't\r\n"
"turn down a drink when our clients want to go another round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1912"
msgid ""
"So you're a new recruit, huh? But still, even in your\r\n"
"situation, you gotta know when to put your foot down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1924"
msgid ""
"You're right. Sometimes I end up doing stupid things, all\r\n"
"because I don't know when to say no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1936"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1948"
msgid ""
"I mean, this isn't how it was supposed to be. I initially\r\n"
"joined this construction firm I'm in because I wanted to\r\n"
"design skyscrapers and other complex architecture work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1960"
msgid ""
"But all I ever do is entertain these two-bit contractors who\r\n"
"want us to build the same old boring apartments, over and\r\n"
"over and over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972"
msgid ""
"Day in and day out, it's nothing but bars and hostess clubs\r\n"
"with a bunch of drunk old men. I'm starting to feel like I'm\r\n"
"not cut out for this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1984"
msgid "If you don't like it, just quit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1996"
msgid "Huh!? But... But I can't just up and⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2008"
msgid ""
"Look at how miserable you are. Better quit while you're\r\n"
"still young and find something you enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2020"
msgid "Maybe you're right. I am still young."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2032"
msgid "In fact, I've already written up a letter of resignation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2044"
msgid ""
"And I'm gonna go slam it on my boss's table! Thanks for the\r\n"
"advice, man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2116"
msgid "When it comes to work, perseverance is key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2128"
msgid ""
"I'm tired of persevering. I've been putting up with so much\r\n"
"crap, I can't take it any longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2140"
msgid ""
"A real man can stick it out to the end. You just need to\r\n"
"be able to discern when enough is enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2152"
msgid "You're making a lot of sense here. All right then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2164"
msgid ""
"We're supposed to be hosting a party at that club over\r\n"
"there, so maybe I'll go face the music like a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2176"
msgid "Thanks for the pep talk. I'll go give it another shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2248"
msgid "Want me to take your place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2260"
msgid "Wait, what!? How can I let you do that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2272"
msgid "You get paid to drink beer and go to clubs, right? I'm sold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2284"
msgid ""
"It's not as attractive as it sounds, man. I'm not supposed\r\n"
"to actually get drunk, and if I end up pissing off the\r\n"
"clients, then our contracts go right down the drain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2296"
msgid "It's not fun at all, let me tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2308"
msgid ""
"But... *sigh* it's my job, and I'm probably whining way too\r\n"
"much. I'll give it another shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2320"
msgid ""
"We're supposed to be hosting a party at that club over\r\n"
"there, so maybe I'll go face the music like a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2380"
msgid "So it's all about money, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2392"
msgid "Do what you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2404"
msgid "For yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2416"
msgid "For money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2428"
msgid "For women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2440"
msgid "If you don't like it, just quit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2452"
msgid "You need more perseverance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2464"
msgid "Want me to take your place?"
msgstr ""

